{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383708-excerpt-from-a-pc-s-prelude-i-wrote-for-a-v5-dark-ages-vampire-campaign-i-m-running","id":1383708,"title":"Excerpt from a PC's prelude I wrote for a V5 Dark Ages Vampire campaign I'm running","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-24T19:24:59-07:00","id":1383708,"title":"Excerpt from a PC's prelude I wrote for a V5 Dark Ages Vampire campaign I'm running","content":"I thought fans of Vampire The Masquerade, especially Malkavians, would really enjoy this. There's a number of bits connected to the VTM meta (I won't say which, though you're welcome to try to puzzle it out).<br /> <br /> Augustus Out of Order, It\u2019s Malkavian Time<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://angelfallchronicles.wordpress.com/2020/04/19/augustus-out-of-order-its-malkavian-time/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://angelfallchronicles.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/cropped-11077505_10155301666670277_796099056_n-1.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://angelfallchronicles.wordpress.com/2020/04/19/augustus-out-of-order-its-malkavian-time/\" target=\"_blank\"> Augustus Out of Order, It&rsquo;s Malkavian Time (Vampire The Masquerade TTRPG Prelude Excerpt) </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://angelfallchronicles.wordpress.com/2020/04/19/augustus-out-of-order-its-malkavian-time/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://angelfallchronicles.wordpress.com/2020/04/19/augustus-out-of-order-its-malkavian-time/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> This short one and a half page excerpt is from a prelude I wrote for a player character in a V5 Dark Ages Vampire campaign I&rsquo;m running. It&rsquo;s written in 2nd person, since it&rsquo;s for &hellip; </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It's one and a half pages, and written in 2nd person, since it's for a tabletop roleplaying campaign, and is heavily laced with cryptic information, some of it nonsense, some of it not, that's been filtered through the Malkavian Madness Network.<br /> <br /> The character, Augustus, is a medieval actor groomed for the embrace by a Toreador, but scooped up and embraced by a Malkavian. It's a dream sequence during the moments that the embrace is taking hold, when Augustus is transitioning from mortal to Cainite.<br /> <br /> I've written 138 pages spread between my seven players' preludes. They made mortals, and gave me a list of clans they'd like to end up being, then I took that info and created preludes for them to play through, which takes them from mortal through their embrace, then up through their first 50+ years of unlife.<br /> <br /> Normally I don't write preludes for my players, and before going ahead with anything, I made sure to discuss what I had in mind for the game with everyone during a session zero. I've learned from experience what can happen when there's poor communication between the storyteller and players, and when they don't have the same expectations of the game that's going to be run, so I like to have very clear goals, expectations, and player buy-in before I run a game.<br /> <br /> If people like this, I'll start posting more preludes and VTM fiction occasionally on my WordPress.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u2019m a writer. A storyteller. They\u2019re my passions. They\u2019re what I do. The stories I tell, they are my mythologies. Like the Norse tales of Odin, Thor, and Loki, or the Celtic fables of Lugh or C\u00fa Chulainn, I want them to be the kind that people retell. They are the legacies I wish to leave behind.","edited":{"userid":577,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/577-archasimos","user":"Archasimos","date":". 05-11-2020, 10:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/577-archasimos","name":"Archasimos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar577_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"180"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-24T22:37:54-07:00","id":1383721,"title":"","content":"Not a huge Malkavian fan, but I don't mind your writing, and I wouldn't mind seeing more of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13136-legendre","name":"Legendre","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"328"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-25T13:53:50-07:00","id":1383837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Legendre</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1383708-excerpt-from-a-pc-s-prelude-i-wrote-for-a-v5-dark-ages-vampire-campaign-i-m-running?p=1383721#post1383721\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not a huge Malkavian fan, but I don't mind your writing, and I wouldn't mind seeing more of it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks. It's always nice to hear that one's work is appreciated. I don't typically enjoy prophecy and such that's cryptic just for the sake of being cryptic. In this case, since it's filtered through the Madness Network, I felt like it worked. Another time I think cryptic prophecy works is when it's the result of a someone receiving visions that they have to interpret when writing them down, in which case they might just be better off writing down exactly what they saw in addition to their interpretations.<br /> <br /> I'll look to putting some more stuff up on my WordPress soon. I have some other stories up on my WordPress, but they're a few years old (hopefully still worth reading). Rereading a few of them, I was able to see that my writing has only continued to improve. I also intend to redesign the site, as it's no longer just for one of my WIP (Angel Fall Chronicles).<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u2019m a writer. A storyteller. They\u2019re my passions. They\u2019re what I do. The stories I tell, they are my mythologies. Like the Norse tales of Odin, Thor, and Loki, or the Celtic fables of Lugh or C\u00fa Chulainn, I want them to be the kind that people retell. They are the legacies I wish to leave behind.","edited":{"userid":577,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/577-archasimos","user":"Archasimos","date":". 04-25-2020, 05:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/577-archasimos","name":"Archasimos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar577_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"180"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T13:00:41-07:00","id":1384249,"title":"","content":"Realized today that if I didn\u2019t go back and add footnotes to the prophetic parts of that scene, I was going to forget what some of it meant lol.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u2019m a writer. A storyteller. They\u2019re my passions. They\u2019re what I do. The stories I tell, they are my mythologies. Like the Norse tales of Odin, Thor, and Loki, or the Celtic fables of Lugh or C\u00fa Chulainn, I want them to be the kind that people retell. They are the legacies I wish to leave behind.","edited":{"userid":577,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/577-archasimos","user":"Archasimos","date":". 04-28-2020, 08:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/577-archasimos","name":"Archasimos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar577_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"180"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}